# Never commit ROM images. Emu28's own author has no license to publish
# them ("I have no license to publish them, so they aren't included in
# the emulator package" - hp.giesselink.com/emu28.htm); this project
# follows the same rule vger and soynut already follow for their own
# ROM dependencies. Supply your own dump and point the emulator at it
# at runtime - it is never checked in here.
*.e28
*.E28
roms/
*.rom
*.ROM
*.bin
!vendor/**/*.bin

# Build artifacts
build/
*.o
*.obj

# Editor/OS cruft
.DS_Store
